{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/110752","id":2847229853,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6ptUed","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110752","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110752.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110752.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110752","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/110752/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/110752/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110752/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/12e97610a825d4e885cb776b72a5c0150ad86f3d","number":110752,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Add `GDSOFTCLASS` to six inheritors of `Object`","user":{"login":"wheatear-dev","id":161692702,"node_id":"U_kgDOCaM8Hg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/161692702?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wheatear-dev","html_url":"https://github.com/wheatear-dev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wheatear-dev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wheatear-dev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wheatear-dev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wheatear-dev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wheatear-dev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wheatear-dev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wheatear-dev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wheatear-dev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wheatear-dev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch in priority.\r\n\r\nRelevant fixes are cherry-picked for stable branches as needed by maintainers.\r\n\r\nTo speed up the contribution process and avoid CI errors, please set up pre-commit hooks locally:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/engine/guidelines/code_style.html\r\n-->\r\n\r\nFurther to bug report #110693, specifically a discussion with @Ivorforce [in this comment](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110693#issuecomment-3315190974), 6 classes were identified that inherit directly from `Object`, but that do not define `GDCLASS` or `GDSOFTCLASS`, and hence may fail static type checks as [in this comment](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102064#pullrequestreview-3244758763) in my unit testing PR #102064.\r\n\r\nThis PR adds `GDSOFTCLASS` to each.\r\n\r\nThey were found using the following `ripgrep` command:\r\n\r\n```bash\r\nrg --pcre2 -n -H -o --multiline --multiline-dotall \\\r\n  '^(class\\s+(\\w+)\\s*:\\s*public\\s+Object\\s*\\{(?:(?!GDCLASS|GDSOFTCLASS).)*?\\})' \\\r\n  --glob '*.h' --glob '*.cpp' \\\r\n  --glob '!*.gen.h' --glob '!test*.h' \\\r\n  --glob '!thirdparty/**' --glob '!drivers/**' --glob '!modules/**' \\\r\n  --replace '$2'\r\n```","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12939969,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AxXLB","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/23","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23/labels","number":23,"state":"closed","title":"